OL,3,GNEWSADriver wrecks #200k Ferrari
OL,4,Asupercar in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ferrari supercar was left a mangled
OL,7,Fwreck when its driver lost control in
OL,8,Fwet conditions.
OL,10,FThe red Ferrari 296, which can cost
OL,11,F#260,000, was crushed in the crash on
OL,12,Fthe M602 in Salford on Sunday.
OL,14,FGreater Manchester Police said
OL,15,F"luckily" the driver had escaped
OL,16,Finjury.
OL,18,FThe bonnet of the high performance car
OL,19,Fwas crushed into a pile of mangled
OL,20,Fmetal, with one of the front wheels
OL,21,Ftwisted out of shape, while the other
OL,22,Fhad completely snapped away.
